k and let us know what you think — just reply to this email or reach out via chat. We built this for you, and your feedback shapes what's next.\n\nThanks for being a customer,\n\nThe Team\n=== END OF TEXT B ===\n\nAnswer with a single JSON object and nothing else:\n{\"more_ai\": \"A\" or \"B\", \"confidence\": 1-5, \"tells_A\": [\"short tell\", ...], \"tells_B\": [\"short tell\", ...]}\n"
